        "minimize" => "M8 3v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3M21 8h-3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V3M3 16h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3M16 21v-3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3"
